% The reports of several programs' runs merged, mini-analyze -summary's
% facts (said(Program, Line), unread(Program, Message)) of each, as
% dead_all.dl merges -dead's: by mini-analyze given several programs
% (Analyze's merged_runs), and tiny_check.sh, ix_check.sh.
%
% -bugs's and -caps's: a report is one of any program that says it (a
% library's function's, said by each program that reaches it, once).
said_any(L) :- said(_, L).
% -exn's: a program's, its toplevel's exceptions its own.
said_by(P, L) :- said(P, L).
% a unit a program could not read: its answer says nothing of it
not_read(P, M) :- unread(P, M).

?- said_any(L).
?- said_by(P, L).
?- not_read(P, M).
